### 11_skills.http
### Testing the Dual-tier Skill Registry REST API

### List All Skills
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/skills
Accept: application/json

### Add or Update a Skill (Database tier, overrides static tier)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/skills
Content-Type: text/plain

---
name: echo-bot
description: Echos user input
trigger-patterns:
  - "echo.*"
tool-capabilities:
  - GITHUB
max-iterations: 3
---
You are an echo bot. Repeat exactly what the user says.

### Refresh the Skill Registry (Forces reload from classpath and DB)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/skills/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Delete a Specific Skill
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/skills/echo-bot
Accept: application/json
